From: skrimix <skrimix.git@fastmail.org>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: caihong: map the splash region

Drop no-map from the splash reservation, as the stock DT has it, so that
the display driver can give the buffer to the page allocator once it has
taken over the bootloader display. The CPU never writes to it while the
bootloader display scans out of it.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650-oneplus-caihong.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650-oneplus-caihong.dts
index 6485ba199..5f1ad6b3b 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650-oneplus-caihong.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650-oneplus-caihong.dts
@@ -158,7 +158,6 @@ ramoops_region {
 		splash_region {
 			label = "cont_splash_region";
 			reg = <0x00 0xd5100000 0x00 0x2b00000>;
-			no-map;
 		};
 	}; 
 
